{"id":1178,"level":68,"name":"Подвійний напад ферзем","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p>The queen can move in all directions. This makes it easy for her to attack two pieces at once. For instance, the king plus a loose piece. Your opponent has to deal with the check. He cannot defend the hanging piece at the same time. Your queen can capture it for free.</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Use the queen to attack two pieces at the same time and win material.</p>  <p>Ask yourself these two questions:</p>  <ul>  <li>Are there any loose pieces?</li>  <li>How can I attack them at the same time?</li>  </ul>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"8/4qp2/1p2p1k1/p2pP3/3P3p/Pb3P2/6PN/2Q3K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb3,Rg6][%cal Gc1b1]} 1. Qb1+ Kg7 2. Qxb3 1-0","text":"<p>Чорний слон незахищений, а чорний король вразливий. Розумним шахом із ферзем білі виграють матеріал. Подвійний напад!</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":48640,"fen":"1r3k2/8/3p4/p2Q1B1p/P4P1P/8/KP6/4q3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yb8,Yf8]} 1. Qxd6+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40589,"fen":"2k5/1pp3n1/p2q4/2Np1p1Q/3P4/P4P2/1PP5/2K5 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc8,Yg7]} 1. Qh8+ Qd8 2. Qxg7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49688,"fen":"3r4/p4p1k/3P2p1/4Q2p/5Pq1/1P6/P1R5/5K2 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rc2,Rf1]} 1... Qd1+ {[%csl Rc2,Rf1][%cal Gd1c2]} 2. Kg2 Qxc2+ 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49035,"fen":"3rk2r/1bq2ppp/p3p2n/1pp1P1Q1/8/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R3R1K1 w k - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yh6,Yh8]} 1. Qxg7 (1. Re3?  ) (1. Ne4?  ) 1... Rg8 2. Qxh6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49677,"fen":"r1b4q/pp4k1/2pN2p1/3nP1n1/4Q1p1/3B2P1/PP3P1P/3R1RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rg5]} 1. Qxg6+ {[%csl Rg5,Rg7]} 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":51293,"fen":"1k1r4/5pQ1/1bbq4/pp3PPp/4P2P/1P6